sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as NexusSaga
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Outbox Relay
    participant K as Kafka
    participant S1 as Inventory
    participant S2 as Payment
    participant S3 as Shipping
    C->>E: POST /sagas/order/start (signed)
    E->>DB: TX: saga IN_PROGRESS + outbox(step1) + audit
    E-->>C: 202 Accepted {sagaId}
    R->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    R->>K: demo.inventory.reserve (key=sagaId)
    K->>S1: FORWARD command
    S1->>K: reply SUCCESS → nexussaga.step.replies
    K->>E: reply
    E->>E: idempotency + stale check (in-memory)
    E->>DB: TX: step=1 + outbox(step2) + audit
    R->>K: demo.payment.charge
    K->>S2: FORWARD
    S2->>K: SUCCESS
    K->>E: reply
    E->>DB: TX: step=2 + outbox(step3) + audit
    R->>K: demo.shipping.create
    K->>S3: FORWARD
    S3->>K: SUCCESS
    K->>E: reply
    E->>DB: TX: COMPLETED + audit SAGA_COMPLETED
    E-->>C: (WebSocket) SAGA_COMPLETED
